"**What happened**\n\n(what you saw, and what you expected)\n\n**Steps**\n\n1. \n\n**Setup**\n\nLess Pull 1.4.4 build %@, macOS %ld.%ld.%ld, %lu display(s)\n\n<details><summary>Diagnostics</summary>\n\n```\n%@\n%@\n```\n</details>\n" = "**發生了什麼**\n\n（你看到的，以及你預期的）\n\n**步驟**\n\n1. \n\n**環境**\n\nLess Pull 1.4.4 組建 %@，macOS %ld.%ld.%ld，%lu 台顯示器\n\n<details><summary>診斷資訊</summary>\n\n```\n%@\n%@\n```\n</details>\n";
