"1. On the page that opened, click Load Temporary Add-on….\n2. Select manifest.json in the Browser Extension (Firefox) folder shown in Finder.\n\nFirefox removes temporary add-ons when it quits; load it again next time, or use Firefox Developer Edition with signing turned off. The extension has no buttons: with a website in front, use “Exception for …” in the Less Pull menu. Keep Less Pull where it is installed; run this setup again if you move it." = "1. 在開啟的頁面中按一下「載入暫用附加元件…」。\n2. 在 Finder 顯示的「Browser Extension (Firefox)」檔案夾中選擇 manifest.json。\n\nFirefox 結束時會移除暫用附加元件；下次請重新載入，或使用關閉了簽署檢查的 Firefox Developer Edition。延伸功能沒有按鈕：網站在最前方時，使用 Less Pull 選單中的「… 的個別設定」。請把 Less Pull 留在安裝位置；若移動了它，請重新執行此設定。";
"1. The Less Pull for Safari app opens; click its Open Safari Settings button.\n2. Turn on Less Pull in Settings → Extensions and allow it on all websites.\n\nThe extension has no buttons: with a website in front, use “Exception for …” in the Less Pull menu. Keep Less Pull where it is installed." = "1. 「Less Pull for Safari」App 會開啟；按一下其中的「打開 Safari 設定」按鈕。\n2. 在 設定 → 延伸功能 中開啟 Less Pull，並允許它存取所有網站。\n\n延伸功能沒有按鈕：網站在最前方時，使用 Less Pull 選單中的「… 的個別設定」。請把 Less Pull 留在安裝位置。";
"1. On the store page that opened, click Add to Chrome, then Add extension. Edge asks once to allow extensions from other stores; Opera may first offer its helper for the Chrome Web Store.\n\nThe extension has no buttons: with a website in front, use “Exception for …” in the Less Pull menu. Keep Less Pull where it is installed." = "1. 在開啟的商店頁面按一下「加到 Chrome」，再按「新增擴充功能」。Edge 會詢問一次是否允許來自其他商店的擴充功能；Opera 可能先推薦它的 Chrome 線上應用程式商店小幫手。\n\n延伸功能沒有按鈕：網站在最前方時，使用 Less Pull 選單中的「… 的個別設定」。請把 Less Pull 留在安裝位置。";
