"A session is a stretch of focused work with a gentle end. Start one from the menu. The icon shows the minutes left; at the end, a soft glow and a calm sound, and the count goes on past the end so you can finish your thought. When you leave, Less Pull can call you back once." = "專注時段是一段溫和收尾的專注工作。從選單開始。圖像顯示剩餘分鐘；結束時有柔和的光暈和平靜的聲音，之後繼續計數，好讓你把思路收完。你離開時，Less Pull 可以喚回你一次。";
