"A Control-click or a two-finger tap on the trackpad counts as a right-click. One of the two always opens the menu. Opens the session panel starts a session, or opens the panel of the one running. Once a session is over, the two trade places: the menu button opens the session panel and the session button opens the menu." = "按住 Control 鍵並按一下或觸控式軌跡板兩指輕點算作按右鍵。兩個按鍵中總有一個打開選單。「打開專注面板」會開始專注，或打開正在進行的專注面板。專注結束後兩者互換：選單鍵打開專注面板，專注鍵打開選單。";
"What this display shows. Follows what is on it: the app in front, or the app on top here, or your defaults. Always your defaults: exceptions never apply here. Always plain: never grayscale or warmth here." = "這台顯示器顯示什麼。「跟隨其上內容」：最前方的 App，或在這裡最前面的 App，或你的預設設定。「一律用預設設定」：個別設定在這裡從不生效。「一律無濾鏡」：這裡從不使用灰階或暖色。";
"Which displays Peek toggles while this app is in front: the display under the pointer, all displays, or any set of connected displays you tick. Works whether or not the exception is used." = "此 App 在最前方時，一瞥切換哪些顯示器：指標所在的顯示器、所有顯示器，或你勾選的任意已連接顯示器。無論個別設定是否啟用都有效。";
