"While a session runs, a click on the icon opens the session panel; the other mouse button opens the menu. Once the session is over, the two trade places, so a click reaches the panel with Keep going and Leave quietly. The Peek and Toggle shortcuts keep working." = "專注進行時，按一下圖像會打開專注面板；另一個滑鼠鍵打開選單。專注結束後兩者互換，按一下就能到達有「繼續」和「就這樣」的面板。「一瞥」和切換快速鍵繼續有效。";
