"With more than one display: peek only on the display under the mouse pointer (a double press keeps that display plain; the next press there lets go, so each display is toggled on its own), or everywhere at once." = "有多台顯示器時：只在滑鼠指標所在的顯示器上一瞥（按兩下可讓該顯示器保持無濾鏡；在那裡再按一下即恢復，每台顯示器獨立切換），或同時在所有顯示器上。";
