"You have arrived somewhere quieter.\n\nLess Pull takes the color out of your screen, so it pulls at you less — a little like stepping out of a loud room into a still one, or leaving the devices behind for a day outside. What matters is still here. It just stops shouting." = "你來到了一個更安靜的地方。\n\nLess Pull 抽走螢幕的顏色，讓它少拉扯你一些——有點像從喧鬧的房間走進安靜的房間，或把裝置留在家裡到戶外過一天。重要的東西還在這裡。只是不再喊叫了。";
