"One browser for website exceptions" = "網站個別設定需要一個瀏覽器";
"Apps get their exceptions right away. Websites need a small extension in your browser, and it is worth knowing what it does: it tells Less Pull which website is in front, nothing more. It cannot read pages or what you type, has no buttons and no network of its own, and never reports private tabs. Without it, website exceptions stay unavailable; Settings → Websites can set it up any time." = "App 的個別設定立即可用。網站需要瀏覽器裡的一個小延伸功能，值得知道它做什麼：它告訴 Less Pull 哪個網站在最前方，僅此而已。它不能讀取頁面或你的輸入，沒有按鈕，沒有自己的網路，也從不回報私密瀏覽標籤頁。沒有它，網站個別設定無法使用；設定 → 網站 隨時可以設定。";
"Found on this Mac. One is enough; more can follow any time." = "在這台 Mac 上找到。一個就夠，之後可以再加。";
"No supported browser found on this Mac yet." = "這台 Mac 上還沒有找到支援的瀏覽器。";
"Set up a browser" = "設定瀏覽器";
"Close the tour without a browser connection. Settings → Websites can set one up later." = "不連接瀏覽器就關閉導覽。設定 → 網站 可以稍後設定。";
"Opens the browser window, where one click connects a browser." = "打開瀏覽器視窗，按一下即可連接一個瀏覽器。";
"Website exceptions need one browser connected" = "網站個別設定需要連接一個瀏覽器";
"The connection takes a minute and is explained first. Apps get their exceptions either way; websites only with it. Settings → Websites can do it later." = "連接只需一分鐘，並且會先說明。App 的個別設定無論如何都可用；網站只有連接後才可用。設定 → 網站 可以稍後再做。";
"Skip for now" = "暫時略過";
"Less Pull %@ is ready to install" = "Less Pull %@ 已可安裝";
"Downloads, checks the signature, replaces the app and reopens it. Settings and exceptions stay as they are." = "下載並檢查簽署，取代 App 後重新打開。設定和個別設定保持不變。";
