"Lock screen:" = "鎖定畫面：";
"Screensaver:" = "螢幕保護程式：";
"Grayscale on the lock screen while Less Pull has it on. It needs a built-in display." = "Less Pull 開著灰階時，鎖定畫面也灰階。需要內建顯示器。";
"Night Shift at full warmth on the lock screen while Less Pull is quieting your screen. Your schedule stays as it is." = "Less Pull 正在讓螢幕安靜時，鎖定畫面上的夜覽調到最暖。排程保持不變。";
"Grayscale while the screensaver runs and Less Pull has it on. It needs a built-in display." = "Less Pull 開著灰階時，螢幕保護程式也灰階。需要內建顯示器。";
"Night Shift at full warmth while the screensaver runs and Less Pull is quieting your screen. Your schedule stays as it is." = "Less Pull 正在讓螢幕安靜時，螢幕保護程式上的夜覽調到最暖。排程保持不變。";
"What the lock screen and the screensaver keep of Less Pull. Grayscale there needs a built-in display; an external display shows only the Night Shift choice. Everything goes back as it was when you return." = "鎖定畫面和螢幕保護程式從 Less Pull 保留什麼。那裡的灰階需要內建顯示器；外接顯示器只有夜覽的選擇生效。你回來時一切恢復原狀。";
"Exception for %@…" = "%@ 的個別設定…";
"Changes apply right away. Click elsewhere or press Escape to close." = "更改立即生效。按一下別處或按 Esc 關閉。";

